  "keyFeatures": [
    "Trajectory simulation using vector addition of swimmer velocity and live CMEMS tidal currents",
    "Adaptive per-cell Principal Component Analysis (PCA) to determine local tidal flow axes",
    "Lunar-cycle-partitioned CMEMS data downloads with asymmetric tidal-lag margins",
    "Automatic peak current detection (Peak Ebb Current / Peak Flood Current) for optimal start times",
    "GPX track export and fishbone visualization plots for navigation planning",
    "Moon phase and synodic cycle calculations via NASA JPL ephemeris (skyfield)",
    "Water level forecasts via HIC KiWIS and MDK Meetnet Vlaamse Banken APIs",
    "YAML-driven simulation job files with conditional activation, email reporting, and WKT obstruction overlays",
    "Built-in wellknown positions (Koksijde, Dover, Kingsgate, Orford Ness) and swimmer profiles"
  ],
